  Cin is the number that matters: two followers add Cin/2 to the
  differential tank, and the tank is only 76.3 fF to begin with.

  Av below 1 is expected for a follower. How far below shows the
  divider between 1/gm and the 50 ohm load — 0.79 at 2 mA, 0.89 at
  4 mA, 0.92 at 6 mA by hand calculation.

  Pick the smallest device and lowest current that still drives the
  load, because every fF of Cbc comes out of the tuning range.

